\par\par \b \uc2 India cbank says sells net $18.7 bln in October\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2008\par 13:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 12 (Reuters) - India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a net $18.7 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in October, when the rupee fell past 50 to a dollar to a lifetime low.\par \par \uc2 It was the biggest single-month sale since the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \uc2 started publishing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures in April 1995, and reflected the fallout from the worst global financial crisis in decades.\par \par \uc2 The RBI sold $20.63 billion in October and bought $1.96 billion, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monthly bulletin showed on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold a net $10.41 billion between January and October, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> fell more than 21 percent in the first 11 months of the year and it hit a record low of 50.65 per dollar last week as foreign funds pulled out more than $13 billion from the stock market.\par \par \uc2 India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have fallen more than a fifth to $246 billion after hitting a peak of $316 billion in May, partly reflecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, the rupee ended at 48.43/45, up 2.4 percent this week as foreign funds bought $565.5 million worth of Indian shares over five sessions.\par \par \uc2 In 2007, the rupee had gained more than 12 percent when foreigners bought a record $17.4 billion of stocks. (Reporting by Saikat Chatterjee; Editing by Ranjit Gangadharan)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SNI|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081212e4cc001bn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
