\par\par \b \uc2 Indian cbank bought net $1.2 bln in August\b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 2008\par 16:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Oct 13 (Reuters) - India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a net $1.2 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August, when the rupee weakened past 44 to the dollar for the first time in nearly 1-\u189\'00\'BD years, data showed on Monday.\par \par \uc2 It was the first net purchases by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  after being net sellers in the previous two months to slow the rupee's slide.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India (RBI) \uc2 bought $3.8 billion in August and sold $2.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 In July, it had sold $9.9 billion, the highest in a month since the RBI began publishing its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures in April 1995, and bought $3.58 billion.\par \par \uc2 The RBI had sold almost $7 billion and bought $1.77 billion in June.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought a net $14.45 billion between January and August, the monthly RBI bulletin showed.\par \par \uc2 The rupee fell 10.3 percent in the first eight months of 2008, ending August at 43.935/945 per dollar <INR=IN>.\par \par \uc2 Last week, it slumped to an all-time low of 49.30 on heavy foreign withdrawals from a sliding stock market.\par \par \uc2 The RBI is suspected to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively to halt the fall in the past few weeks. On Monday, the rupee ended at 48.25/27, down 18.3 percent this year.\par \par \uc2 In 2007, record portfolio inflows of $17.4 billion had helped the rupee climb to a near decade high of 39.16 in November last year. In comparison, foreign funds are net sellers of $10.8 billion so far this year. (Reporting by Anurag Joshi; Editing by Ranjit Gangadharan)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/ \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SNI|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081013e4ad001dg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
