64.5 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first 10 months of the year.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\par                    MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index         <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)              <INR=IN>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by C.J. Kurrien; Editing by John Mair)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE/(UPDATE 1, REPEAT)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071220e3ch000qz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
