\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee climbs on pvt equity flow; cbank seen   \b0\par\par\uc2 361 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2007\par 04:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 7 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee climbed on Friday buoyed by a single sale of dollars by a private equity firm in a deal estimated at around $500 million, though suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  limited gains, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> ended at 39.395/405 per dollar, heading back towards a near-decade high of 39.16 hit last month, and moving up from the previous finish of 39.485/495.   \par \par \uc2 "It's really the big deal done by a British bank that moved the market today, though RBI was there to see that the rupee did not get ahead of itself," said a dealer with a foreign bank, referring to the Reserve Bank of India.   \par \par \uc2 Overseas funds have been a key driver of the rupee's more than 12 percent rise this year, helping it to be among Asia's best-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar this year.   \par \par \uc2 Foreign funds have stepped up their purchases of Indian shares this month after remaining tepid in November, when they pulled out about $1.1 billion.   \par \par \uc2 Sentiment for the rupee was boosted as India's main share index <.BSESN> rose 0.9 percent, led by banking and software services, with investor expectations of a U.S. rate cut underpinning the rise. The U.S. Federal Reserve, which meets on Dec. 11, is widely expected to lower the key federal funds rate by 25 basis points to 4.25 percent. It has cut rates twice since mid-September, widening the interest differential with India's rates.   \par \par \uc2 Still, the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the local unit in a bid to temper its ascent.   \par \par \uc2 According to the latest data, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $52 billion through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first nine months of the year, and is also seen as having played an active role in the rupee market in October and November too. (Reporting by C.J. Kurrien, Editing by Mark Williams)   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|Table|SNI|ABN|M|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071210e3c70005j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
